'' TKO0870: A PUBLIC NAME SPELLED LIKE ITS MODULE (M27; RFC-0001 §2) -- an importer would
'' write 'http.Http( )', and after 'using http' the module and the name would collide.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c -i tests/diagnostics/src/modules/selfname/libs tests/diagnostics/src/modules/selfname/libs/acme/http -o tests/diagnostics/selfname.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: http.bas(3,8): error TKO0870: public 'http' has the same name as its module 'http'
